# React Native & Expo

This project uses Expo SDK 57. Use Expo SDK 57 APIs only and avoid deprecated APIs. Follow React best practices.

## Components

- Functional components only.
- Prefer hooks over classes.
- Keep components focused.
- Components should generally stay under 250 lines.
- Prefer named exports.

## State & effects

- Prefer derived state instead of duplicated state.
- Avoid unnecessary `useEffect` calls.
- Prefer memoization only when needed.
- Avoid prop drilling when context or composition is better.

## TypeScript & structure

- TypeScript everywhere.
- Keep imports organized.
- Keep files easy to navigate.
